Source: mediatools
Section: python
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Reuben Institute <reubeninstitute@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, pybuild-plugin-pyproject, python3-all, python3-setuptools
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: python3-mediatools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-ffmpeg, python3-mutagen, python3-pil, ffmpeg
Description: Local media utilities and ElevenLabs API wrapper
 Provides Media (ffmpeg/mutagen/PIL-based tagging, cover art, scaling,
 probing) and Services (ElevenLabs API wrapper: TTS, speech-to-speech,
 forced/word alignment) for Reuben Institute's media pipeline. The
 elevenlabs package itself is not a hard dependency — Services imports
 it lazily per function.
